@JeanMeche I was playing with the code, trying to simplify it a bit, here is the version that I came up with:
```
@Component({
  selector: 'app-ad-banner',
  standalone: true,
  imports: [NgComponentOutlet, AsyncPipe],
  template: `
    <div class="ad-banner-example">
      <h3>Advertisements</h3>
      <ng-container *ngComponentOutlet="
        currentAd.component() | async;
        inputs: currentAd.inputs;
      " />
      <button (click)="displayNextAd()">Next</button>
    </div>
  `,
})
export class AdBannerComponent implements OnInit, OnDestroy {
  adList = inject(AdService).getAds();

  currentAdIndex = 0;

  get currentAd() {
    return this.adList[this.currentAdIndex];
  }

  displayNextAd() {
    this.currentAdIndex = (this.currentAdIndex + 1) % this.adList.length;
  }
}
```
Please let me know what you think! If it looks good, we can also update the text of this cookbook as well (and simplify it) - I can help with that. Thank you.
